@startuml SEQ-10
!include ../theme.puml
title SEQ-10 — Yêu cầu chỉnh sửa ảnh
actor Customer
participant CustomerDeliveryController
participant DeliveryServiceImpl
participant DeliveryAlbumRepository
participant BookingStateMachineServiceImpl
participant NotificationServiceImpl
database "SQL Server" as DB
Customer -> CustomerDeliveryController : POST /bookings/{id}/delivery/request-revision
CustomerDeliveryController -> DeliveryServiceImpl : requestRevision(id,userId,notes)
DeliveryServiceImpl -> DeliveryServiceImpl : owner + album DELIVERED checks
group @Transactional
  DeliveryServiceImpl -> DeliveryAlbumRepository : status=REVISION_REQUESTED, notes
  DeliveryAlbumRepository -> DB
  DeliveryServiceImpl -> BookingStateMachineServiceImpl : DELIVERED -> POST_PROCESSING
  DeliveryServiceImpl -> NotificationServiceImpl : notify photographer
end
CustomerDeliveryController --> Customer : revision accepted
note right of DeliveryAlbumRepository
  Không có revision number/history riêng;
  trạng thái và notes bị cập nhật trên cùng album.
end note
@enduml

